  "paper_diagnosis": "Dengue shock syndrome complicated with acute liver failure and kidney injury, infective endocarditis, and deep vein thrombosis",
  "disease_label_per_paper": "Dengue shock syndrome with acute liver failure, acute kidney injury, and later infectious and thrombotic complications",
